{"id":"steam-1072910","steam":1072910,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Drill Man Rumble","summary":"Drill Man Rumble is a hand drawn fast paced action game with single and multiplayer features. Take on the legend of Drill Mountain in the campaign. Drill your friends in danger-filled arenas, ride mechanical Drill-agons, and battle strangers for riches in the endless Bounty Mode.","about":"In a world powered by the endless revolutions of the Great Drill. There is no greater honor than being a Drill Warrior! Every 10 years each of the Tribes of Kiel put forth a warrior to fight in the Great Tournament! Bring honor and glory to your tribe, Driller! \r\n\r\nDrill Man Rumble pits drill wielding warriors in a battle for supremacy! Master a wide variety of drills and compete across danger filled arenas. Fearsome Drillers, each with unique abilities, can choose from an arsenal of unique drills for the battles ahead, but never forget, one hit and you're done. Drills take no prisoners!\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\nFeatures\n \r\n\r\n\n \r\n•  Intense online and offline Arena Mode for up to 4 players. \r\n•  Get rich in the endless 8 Player Bounty Mode and hunt down the richest player to fill your coffers.  \r\n•  Use your favorite character to conquer the Drill Mountain in the single player campaign. \r\n•  Select one of 11 Drillers, each with their own special abilities \r\n•  Wield incredible drills with a unique feature, from Super Speed to Rebounding Mayhem88 \r\n•  Swing, teleport, use Ninja abilities, and ghostly stealth to destroy the competition.  \r\n•  Take your drilling to the next level (literally) in hardcore platforming challenges!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072910/library_600x900.jpg?t=1723617949","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072910/header.jpg?t=1723617949","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072910/library_hero.jpg?t=172361